{"title":"Career roadmap · Banking Executive","role":"Banking Executive","summary":"A Banking Executive works across banking operations, customer service, financial products, credit support, account services, compliance, payments, and relationship management.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Banking Executive works across banking operations, customer service, financial products, credit support, account services, compliance, payments, and relationship management."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Applied Economics / Financial Economics provides a strong foundation in economics, financial markets, monetary policy, banking, statistics, econometrics, and financial analysis. To become competitive for banking roles, students should add accounting basics, banking operations, financial regulations, Excel, data analytics, digital banking, KYC/AML, and customer-facing skills."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Applied Economics","Banking Knowledge","Financial Analysis","Data","Digital Banking","Compliance"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Banking Intern, Banking Operations Associate"},{"text":"Customer and operational support"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Banking Executive, Banking Associate"},{"text":"Accounts, transactions, service"}],[{"text":"Developing"},{"text":"Senior Banking Executive, Relationship Executive"},{"text":"Customer/portfolio management"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Credit Analyst, Relationship Manager, Branch Operations Officer"},{"text":"Credit, sales or operations"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Branch Manager, Credit Manager, Operations Manager"},{"text":"Branch/functional leadership"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Regional Manager, A